          "identification_status": "contextual_provisional",
          "interpretation_note": "《梁書》明記父王粹、祖王僧朗及兄王奐。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p004",
      "text": "長子琳，字孝璋，舉南徐州秀才，釋褐征虜建安王法曹、司徒東閤祭酒，南平王文學。尚義興公主，拜駙馬都尉。",
      "text_layer": "received_chapter",
      "annotation_status": "in_progress",
      "mentions": [
        {
          "id": "c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p004:m0002",
          "start": 2,
          "end": 3,
          "surface": "琳",
          "kind": "person",
          "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABA",
          "identification_status": "contextual_provisional",
          "interpretation_note": "《梁書》《南史》王份傳均以琳為其長子。"
        },
        {
          "id": "c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p004:m0005",
          "start": 5,
          "end": 7,
          "surface": "孝璋",
          "kind": "person",
          "person_id": "q7m_r8k_2vn_ABA",
          "identification_status": "contextual_provisional",
          "interpretation_note": "《梁書》《南史》王份傳均以琳為其長子。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p005",
      "text": "錫字公嘏，琳之第二子也。",
      "text_layer": "received_chapter",
      "annotation_status": "in_progress",
      "mentions": [
        {
          "id": "c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p005:m0000",
