          "identification_status": "contextual_provisional",
          "interpretation_note": "《梁書》稱琳之第二子，字公嘏；與《宋書》王弘之子王錫為異人。"
        },
        {
          "id": "c-liangshu-021-wangfen:p005:m0002",
